  "body": "token layout strides should be encoded in int64 for safety; left-most stride can get pretty big, especially if users go beyond the typical 128 head dim, and have high token counts on the right.\r\n\r\nSome small regressions (up to ~ 15%) are expected.\r\n\r\nFixes #335.",
